00:26:27.260 --> 00:26:29.150
Thanks to you, I was saved.

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:32.880
What do you want to say to me?

00:26:32.880 --> 00:26:35.880
I have one more favor to ask you.

00:26:35.880 --> 00:26:40.050
Would you like me to take this man out to the King?

00:26:40.050 --> 00:26:44.910
Well, it's just a matter of my heart.

00:26:44.910 --> 00:26:48.940
Please take care of me!

00:26:48.940 --> 00:26:55.600
By the way, Rina.

00:26:55.600 --> 00:26:57.970
It's about time.

00:26:57.970 --> 00:26:59.830
It's about time, isn't it?

00:27:04.060 --> 00:27:08.760
Welcome, welcome. I've been waiting for you, Ms. Rina Inba.

00:27:08.760 --> 00:27:11.180
What?

00:27:11.180 --> 00:27:14.980
No, no, it's nothing. I'm glad to see you.

00:27:14.980 --> 00:27:21.860
But I'm a professional, too. I have a lot of pride.

00:27:21.860 --> 00:27:25.390
Hmm, pride, huh?

00:27:25.390 --> 00:27:28.320
Sometimes, Ms. Rina, you were born...

00:27:28.320 --> 00:27:30.000
Huh? I'm Zephilia.

00:27:30.890 --> 00:27:32.330
Oho...

00:27:32.330 --> 00:27:34.610
Zephilia.

00:27:34.610 --> 00:27:37.220
Speaking of Zephilia...

00:27:37.220 --> 00:27:38.000
It's that...

00:27:38.000 --> 00:27:39.280
That magnificent...

00:27:39.280 --> 00:27:41.910
Black God of Blessing from Heaven.

00:27:41.910 --> 00:27:45.020
If you chew that fruit in your mouth...

00:27:45.020 --> 00:27:46.370
If you chew that fruit in your mouth...

00:27:46.370 --> 00:27:48.920
You'll be able to enjoy its richly-spread sweet taste...

00:27:48.920 --> 00:27:52.720
And people will forget that time is passing by.

00:27:52.720 --> 00:27:53.520
That's right.

00:27:53.520 --> 00:27:58.260
It's the Zephilia Grape, the world's most acclaimed grape.

00:28:00.570 --> 00:28:03.810
I can see it! I can see it!

00:28:03.810 --> 00:28:15.990
...the grape harvest festival!

00:28:15.990 --> 00:28:20.000
This year's Bonjore Noob, Yaikani!

00:28:20.000 --> 00:28:23.110
"This is how you make wine!"

00:28:23.110 --> 00:28:26.880
...with the feet of a maiden who knows nothing about impurities!

00:28:33.840 --> 00:28:38.040
So, young lady, your birth is...

00:28:38.040 --> 00:28:38.870
Move!

00:28:41.810 --> 00:28:47.810
You showed me the Rina Inverse's "Taku Odori" and you're trying to steal my fiber? You're a bit too naive!

00:28:47.810 --> 00:28:49.660
W-What are you doing?!

00:28:49.660 --> 00:28:52.450
Moon Raiwa!

00:29:11.070 --> 00:29:11.930
Boss!

00:29:11.930 --> 00:29:13.210
H-Hirumura!

00:29:13.210 --> 00:29:15.290
We are true entertainers!

00:29:15.290 --> 00:29:20.980
No matter who the opponent is, if you don't accept it, there's no tomorrow!

00:29:20.980 --> 00:29:22.290
Umm...

00:29:22.290 --> 00:29:24.610
You are...

00:30:20.280 --> 00:30:21.350
-

00:30:30.120 --> 00:30:31.610
It's a difference in consciousness.

00:30:31.610 --> 00:30:35.640
With that difference, are you going to destroy a quarter of the town?

00:30:48.210 --> 00:30:49.560
I see.

00:30:49.560 --> 00:30:57.240
But to make such a dragon, it's a pretty good job.

00:30:57.240 --> 00:31:00.000
Of course.

00:31:00.250 --> 00:31:05.900
I am Naga, Hakujya's Naga!

00:31:05.900 --> 00:31:11.690
By the way, who are you?

00:31:11.690 --> 00:31:14.670
Rina, Rina Inverse.

00:31:14.670 --> 00:31:20.530
Oh, you are Rina Inverse?

00:31:20.530 --> 00:31:24.450
Oh, I see, as rumored.

00:31:24.450 --> 00:31:29.920
You have a small body and a small chest.

00:31:37.580 --> 00:31:39.700
I'll get angry at you, sister-in-law!

00:31:39.700 --> 00:31:42.780
Sister-in-law? You're already angry, aren't you?

00:31:42.780 --> 00:31:45.990
No, I just dropped a kick in the tower.

00:31:45.990 --> 00:31:46.690
Huh?

00:31:46.690 --> 00:31:47.470
Oh!

00:31:47.470 --> 00:31:48.040
Eh?

00:31:48.040 --> 00:31:50.360
Ah, more than that, more than anything else!

00:31:50.360 --> 00:31:51.200
What?

00:31:51.200 --> 00:31:52.150
Ah, ah, ah!

00:31:52.150 --> 00:31:55.310
We'll talk about it later.

00:31:55.310 --> 00:31:56.010
How about it?

00:31:56.010 --> 00:31:58.590
Why don't you stay in the castle tonight?

00:31:58.590 --> 00:31:59.880
That's a good idea.

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:01.190
That's right.

00:32:01.190 --> 00:32:01.820
Huh?

00:32:01.820 --> 00:32:04.400
If that's the case, then the feast is ready.

00:32:04.400 --> 00:32:10.350
Hey, who is it?

00:32:10.350 --> 00:32:13.690
Don't you think you've forgotten someone important?

00:32:13.690 --> 00:32:16.140
Oh, by the way, you...

00:32:16.140 --> 00:32:20.490
Hmph. I am Rina's strongest and last rival.

00:32:20.490 --> 00:32:26.340
I'm Nagasane, the golden bird of poop.

00:32:26.340 --> 00:32:29.350
Welcome to the castle.

00:33:32.520 --> 00:33:35.330
My name is Rao, the great swordsman.

00:33:35.330 --> 00:33:42.060
I wish this island to return to its original form.

00:33:42.060 --> 00:33:48.060
But...

00:33:48.060 --> 00:33:49.390
Are you ready, Rina?

00:33:49.390 --> 00:33:51.390
I don't have time to talk in detail.

00:33:51.390 --> 00:33:56.910
I will go through the forest of Garin in the north and head to the ruins of the Elm Goshi.

00:33:56.910 --> 00:33:59.800
I don't listen to what people say at all.

00:34:00.190 --> 00:34:04.440
This old man is...

00:34:04.440 --> 00:34:08.210
We're going to go to Enjutsu's ruins!

00:34:08.210 --> 00:34:19.470
Enjutsu's ruins!

00:34:19.470 --> 00:34:26.000
What are you doing?

00:34:26.000 --> 00:34:27.770
Are you awake?

00:34:27.770 --> 00:34:30.000
Did you wake up?

00:34:35.790 --> 00:34:42.300
There is another village at the foot of the northern mountain beyond the ruins of this Mipros Island.

00:34:42.300 --> 00:34:46.800
The real hot spring was flowing from that village to here.

00:34:46.800 --> 00:34:51.220
That's why a monster lived in the ruins last year.

00:34:51.220 --> 00:34:52.750
A monster?

00:34:52.750 --> 00:34:53.250
Yes.

00:34:53.250 --> 00:35:00.000
I sent a life force to the ruins several times, but the frog also came back with difficulty.

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:06.480
I don't know what happened to her, so I don't know who she really is.

00:35:06.480 --> 00:35:13.010
Thanks to that, the relationship with the northern village has stopped, and the hot springs that flow here have also dried up.

00:35:13.010 --> 00:35:15.350
And about a month ago?

00:35:15.350 --> 00:35:21.940
Yes, we were able to see the dreams of the great sage called Laudy every night.

00:35:21.940 --> 00:35:24.040
What? The kings too?

00:35:24.040 --> 00:35:30.000
Yes, to say that the great sage is now a lazy person called Rina Inverse.

00:35:30.220 --> 00:35:32.540
I don't have a chest, but I have the capacity of magic.

00:35:34.250 --> 00:35:38.350
It's not me, it's a great sage who seems to be great.

00:35:38.350 --> 00:35:41.770
Leave the monster extermination to Rina Inverse.

00:35:41.770 --> 00:35:43.770
I didn't hear that story.

00:35:45.870 --> 00:35:49.070
I wonder if I can get you to accept it somehow.

00:35:49.420 --> 00:35:55.590
There is also the repair cost of the city that you have destroyed.

00:35:55.590 --> 00:35:58.470
Yeah, that's that, this is this.

00:35:59.530 --> 00:36:00.000
Yeah.

00:36:00.000 --> 00:36:05.500
I don't even have to worry about the interest rate.

00:36:05.500 --> 00:36:11.240
Leave it to me!

00:36:11.240 --> 00:36:14.190
This is the food for three days, and here's the order.

00:36:14.190 --> 00:36:18.430
Well then, I'll leave it to you, D-9-verse.

00:36:30.640 --> 00:36:39.290
Huh?

00:36:39.290 --> 00:36:40.530
You don't have it, do you?

00:36:40.530 --> 00:36:49.560
Meow!

00:36:49.560 --> 00:36:56.780
But I can't pay for it.

00:36:56.780 --> 00:36:58.300
Right, Rina?

00:36:58.300 --> 00:36:59.120
Huh?

00:36:59.120 --> 00:36:59.860
Rina!

00:37:23.770 --> 00:37:27.170
Now, Inverse, hurry up to the ruins!

00:37:30.000 --> 00:37:40.440
I'm going to kick you in the dream.

00:37:40.440 --> 00:37:42.890
As expected, I'll do it.

00:37:42.890 --> 00:37:44.960
What is it?

00:37:44.960 --> 00:37:49.520
It's my dream, so if I believe I can do it, I can do anything.

00:37:49.520 --> 00:37:50.900
That's right.

00:37:54.490 --> 00:37:57.330
Now, let's talk about it in detail.

00:37:57.330 --> 00:38:00.000
Hmm, even if I talk about it...

00:38:00.250 --> 00:38:04.170
But you want to ask me for something, don't you?

00:38:04.170 --> 00:38:12.710
When I live to this age, I can look ahead a little.

00:38:12.710 --> 00:38:20.840
So, even if you ask me, it has something to do with you.

00:38:20.840 --> 00:38:27.390
Anyway, a request is a reward that suits it and is the first to be established, isn't it?

00:38:27.390 --> 00:38:30.000
Reward, huh?

00:38:35.050 --> 00:38:36.130
What?

00:38:36.130 --> 00:38:39.990
Actually, there is a hot spring that only I know.

00:38:39.990 --> 00:38:40.920
Hot spring?

00:38:40.920 --> 00:38:46.610
I can't say it in a loud voice, but it's called "Spring of Growth".

00:38:46.610 --> 00:38:48.220
What?

00:38:48.220 --> 00:38:54.000
The quick story is that it will speed up your growth.

00:38:54.000 --> 00:38:55.540
Growth?

00:38:55.540 --> 00:38:56.680
Speed up?

00:38:56.680 --> 00:39:00.000
I'm getting taller, and...

00:39:00.570 --> 00:39:03.590
What is it?

00:39:49.740 --> 00:39:53.080
Let's go see that monster!

00:40:01.950 --> 00:40:07.480
Jeez, there are so many ruins and dungeons, it's too dark to see anything.

00:40:08.830 --> 00:40:09.330
Hm?

00:40:09.330 --> 00:40:14.340
By the way...

00:40:14.340 --> 00:40:17.790
What's the welcome sign?

00:40:17.790 --> 00:40:18.790
This is number one.

00:40:18.790 --> 00:40:20.250
Do your best.

00:40:28.280 --> 00:40:30.000
Let's go at the shortest distance.

00:40:39.980 --> 00:40:56.530
Hey, this is the lowest level.

00:41:30.380 --> 00:41:34.680
You know, that person my mother told me.

00:41:34.680 --> 00:41:37.480
I don't care who you are or what kind of person you are.

00:41:37.480 --> 00:41:43.830
What about the treasure? What about the treasure?

00:42:30.510 --> 00:42:36.140
It's going to be fun, isn't it, Rina Inverse?

00:42:36.140 --> 00:42:38.020
Shall I ask you a question?

00:42:38.020 --> 00:42:40.700
Call me Joyrock.

00:42:40.700 --> 00:42:42.560
Well then, Joyrock.

00:42:42.560 --> 00:42:44.540
What do you intend to do?

00:42:44.540 --> 00:42:47.540
Manage the islanders and make money?

00:42:47.540 --> 00:42:49.540
Or take care of the hot springs?

00:42:49.540 --> 00:42:51.540
That's what I'm going to do!

00:42:51.540 --> 00:42:56.910
But Chris!

00:42:56.910 --> 00:43:00.000
Be careful, Joyrock-chan!

00:43:00.380 --> 00:43:01.760
Useless thing!

00:43:01.760 --> 00:43:12.770
Ehehe, will you show me something more interesting?

00:43:12.770 --> 00:43:15.680
No, no, it's just a little trick to tell you...

00:43:15.680 --> 00:43:27.110
Are you a demon?

00:43:27.110 --> 00:43:28.900
Pena!

00:43:32.170 --> 00:43:33.280
Heh heh heh...

00:43:33.280 --> 00:43:36.310
You're pretty cool, aren't you?

00:43:36.310 --> 00:43:44.920
For me, your appearance and shape are the same as mine.

00:43:44.920 --> 00:43:48.370
If you want, I can make you look even more different!

00:43:48.370 --> 00:43:56.240
Heh heh...

00:43:56.240 --> 00:43:58.520
That old man is not a joke, but...

00:43:58.520 --> 00:44:00.000
What are you looking forward to?

00:44:00.090 --> 00:44:00.580
From now on...

00:44:40.110 --> 00:44:42.130
That's very kind of you.

00:44:42.130 --> 00:44:43.320
Thank you.

00:44:43.320 --> 00:44:46.640
By the way, you three...

00:44:46.640 --> 00:44:52.140
Sit down, Rina!

00:44:52.140 --> 00:44:53.090
Rina!

00:44:53.090 --> 00:44:53.750
Huh?

00:45:30.730 --> 00:45:32.730
What are you laughing at?

00:45:32.730 --> 00:45:34.770
It's interesting and delicious.

00:45:34.770 --> 00:45:36.750
It's interesting?

00:45:36.750 --> 00:45:41.180
I thought you demons were living with fear of people.

00:45:41.180 --> 00:45:45.060
There are people who have changed even to humans.

00:45:45.060 --> 00:45:47.080
There are people who have changed even to demons.

00:45:47.080 --> 00:45:48.970
Like me.

00:45:50.990 --> 00:45:57.880
And humans' selfish emotions are also very delicate.

00:45:57.880 --> 00:45:59.700
I see.

00:46:00.860 --> 00:46:02.920
The islanders did the same thing you did.

00:46:08.220 --> 00:46:09.780
Yes, that's right.

00:46:09.980 --> 00:46:11.690
What do you mean?

00:46:11.790 --> 00:46:13.150
Well...

00:46:13.250 --> 00:46:17.050
If you want to play, you can do it yourself.

00:46:17.150 --> 00:46:20.160
The islanders are not your toys.

00:46:20.260 --> 00:46:21.650
They are my toys!

00:46:21.750 --> 00:46:24.910
They are my toys, humans!

00:46:26.430 --> 00:46:28.420
Like this...

00:47:02.590 --> 00:47:08.960
Anger and fear are the best appetizers for me.

00:47:08.960 --> 00:47:12.870
The battle has begun.

00:47:12.870 --> 00:47:19.160
As expected, I'm getting angry too.

00:47:19.160 --> 00:47:21.310
Move, Naga.

00:47:21.310 --> 00:47:24.640
Yeah.

00:47:24.640 --> 00:47:29.270
It's darker than it looks.

00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:32.080
Heh heh heh heh heh heh...

00:47:32.080 --> 00:47:34.070
A reddish thing than the flow of blood...

00:47:34.070 --> 00:47:36.030
What is it?

00:47:36.030 --> 00:47:38.040
Buried in the flow of time...

00:47:38.040 --> 00:47:40.240
In the name of the great Nanji...

00:47:40.240 --> 00:47:42.430
Huh?

00:47:42.430 --> 00:47:44.430
I swear to the darkness...

00:47:44.430 --> 00:47:46.920
H-Hey...

00:47:46.920 --> 00:47:48.920
I will stand before you...

00:47:48.920 --> 00:47:51.210
No way...

00:47:51.210 --> 00:47:53.160
To all the foolish ones...

00:47:53.160 --> 00:47:56.520
Nanji and I have the power...

00:47:56.520 --> 00:47:58.870
You're kidding, right?

00:47:58.870 --> 00:48:00.000
Equally!

00:48:31.980 --> 00:48:32.820
Did you do it?

00:48:32.820 --> 00:48:35.870
Probably.

00:48:35.870 --> 00:48:42.940
Let's get out of here!

00:48:42.940 --> 00:48:48.310
I wanted to see you.

00:48:48.310 --> 00:48:49.690
I found you!

00:48:49.690 --> 00:48:52.060
Don't move.

00:48:52.060 --> 00:48:54.100
You surprised me.

00:48:54.100 --> 00:48:57.560
I didn't expect such a small human being to do such a thing.

00:48:57.560 --> 00:48:59.890
Hehehehe.

00:49:00.030 --> 00:49:02.470
You're in the way of playing, aren't you?

00:49:02.470 --> 00:49:04.640
Die!

00:49:07.980 --> 00:49:11.430
What?

00:49:11.430 --> 00:49:15.310
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:49:15.310 --> 00:49:20.800
If you're wondering who I am, I'm the old man of the Laudy family.

00:49:20.800 --> 00:49:22.720
I can't believe it.

00:49:22.720 --> 00:49:30.000
I thought it would be fun to have someone who would oppose me, so I let you live.

00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:34.710
But it's annoying when there are three of us.

00:49:34.710 --> 00:49:37.970
Well, I'll take care of this place.

00:49:37.970 --> 00:49:43.090
Shall I lend you a hand?

00:50:00.540 --> 00:50:02.820
Well then, let me tell you something.

00:50:02.820 --> 00:50:07.970
This is the old me and Merry Rune.

00:50:07.970 --> 00:50:15.290
This place used to be so connected that you could walk across the continent.

00:50:15.290 --> 00:50:19.170
That's right, until he appeared.

00:50:19.170 --> 00:50:20.360
He?

00:50:20.360 --> 00:50:22.240
You mean Joylock?

00:50:22.240 --> 00:50:23.200
Yes.

00:50:23.200 --> 00:50:30.000
That day was a village festival in the Forest of Elves.

00:50:35.210 --> 00:50:41.930
He appeared at the time of the Takenawa incident.

00:50:41.930 --> 00:50:43.460
And then...

00:50:43.460 --> 00:50:52.030
The massacre began.

00:50:52.030 --> 00:50:59.380
At that time, I was...

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:05.950
Defeating Lesser Daemon, who suddenly appeared, I was in a hurry to go to the Elf Forest.

00:51:05.950 --> 00:51:13.200
But I was already late.

00:51:13.200 --> 00:51:24.160
But I challenged Joylock.

00:51:24.160 --> 00:51:28.840
But I was not even able to hurt him.

00:51:34.700 --> 00:51:40.210
This guy, Joylock, will disappear into the darkness with Takawarai.

00:52:12.440 --> 00:52:20.810
This island has been isolated from the world by its own will and has been moving at a strange rate of time.

00:52:20.810 --> 00:52:30.000
Since then, I have not been able to die, and I have been living here for a long time.

00:52:30.000 --> 00:52:34.360
I live with the soul of the Meriloon.

00:52:34.360 --> 00:52:37.060
Are you still in love?

00:52:37.060 --> 00:52:39.160
Yes.

00:52:39.160 --> 00:52:42.880
But after a long time,

00:52:42.880 --> 00:52:46.690
last year when he came back to this island,

00:52:46.690 --> 00:52:49.080
I clearly understood.

00:52:49.080 --> 00:53:00.000
Does that mean you're trying to change the past?

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:03.910
A future with a past that cannot be changed and a future that should be.

00:53:03.910 --> 00:53:09.640
That's what this island wants.

00:53:30.510 --> 00:53:32.440
Hehehe...

00:53:32.440 --> 00:53:42.900
I am alone.

00:53:42.900 --> 00:53:56.250
This island's feelings...

00:53:56.250 --> 00:53:57.550
My soul...

00:53:57.550 --> 00:53:59.960
And your magic...

00:54:02.880 --> 00:54:06.700
It's not over yet! The door of time will open now!

00:54:08.480 --> 00:54:09.510
No way!

00:54:58.380 --> 00:54:59.380
I'm not kidding.

00:55:00.540 --> 00:55:03.020
I won't leave the rest to you, Luna Inverse!

00:55:03.020 --> 00:55:05.020
You are the greatest!

00:55:05.020 --> 00:55:06.330
Wait!

00:55:06.330 --> 00:55:08.610
What do you mean you are the greatest!?

00:55:48.940 --> 00:55:51.270
You're Rina Inverse, aren't you?

00:55:51.270 --> 00:55:54.270
Is that me?

00:55:54.270 --> 00:55:56.830
My name is...

00:55:56.830 --> 00:55:59.700
I'm coming out.

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:02.180
You're Judy Gavrijev, aren't you?

00:56:02.180 --> 00:56:03.090
I'm in a hurry.

00:56:03.090 --> 00:56:04.120
Rai-

00:56:04.120 --> 00:56:06.540
!

00:56:06.540 --> 00:56:08.000
!

00:56:08.000 --> 00:56:09.000
!

00:56:09.000 --> 00:56:11.550
!

00:56:11.550 --> 00:56:13.300
!

00:56:37.710 --> 00:56:47.420
I understand, the first Joylock-san.

00:56:49.860 --> 00:56:51.860
What do you mean you don't understand?

00:56:52.420 --> 00:56:55.300
Do you want me to play with you, young lady?

00:56:55.520 --> 00:56:55.990
That's right!

00:56:58.820 --> 00:57:00.000
Let me sleep!

00:57:31.400 --> 00:57:34.900
Isn't that what you call the sword of light?

00:57:34.900 --> 00:57:37.870
Darker than the twilight...

00:57:37.870 --> 00:57:41.020
Come on, show me!

00:57:41.020 --> 00:57:42.800
Buried in the flow of time...

00:57:42.800 --> 00:57:44.140
Magnificent...

00:57:48.880 --> 00:57:49.810
To all...

00:57:49.810 --> 00:57:51.280
Foolish beings...

00:57:51.280 --> 00:57:53.990
I will not let you perish in the same way!

00:57:55.080 --> 00:57:55.920
DRAGON!

00:58:39.080 --> 00:58:40.250
Hey, Laodi-kun!

00:58:40.250 --> 00:58:41.060
I don't want to!

00:58:41.060 --> 00:58:42.360
You're such a jerk.

00:58:42.360 --> 00:58:46.550
Because this sword has been passed down to us for a long time.

00:58:46.550 --> 00:58:48.620
I can't give it to you.

00:58:53.460 --> 00:58:55.060
I have to go now.

00:58:55.060 --> 00:58:57.930
Rina-san, thank you.

00:59:32.270 --> 00:59:37.080
What is the reward you are talking about?

00:59:37.080 --> 00:59:42.160
That's right. I just met you for the first time.

00:59:42.160 --> 00:59:52.820
Oh, the history has changed.

00:59:52.820 --> 00:59:54.580
If you do it, you can do it.

00:59:54.580 --> 00:59:56.720
That's right.

00:59:56.720 --> 01:00:00.000
Naga, I just remembered something.

01:00:30.120 --> 01:00:32.720
Eh? It's over there, behind the rock mountain.

01:00:32.720 --> 01:00:36.120
Huh?

01:00:36.120 --> 01:00:49.560
-Gudoki-doki-so-a-sa- -What the hell are you looking at?

01:00:49.560 --> 01:00:58.110
The hot springs here are used for vegetable-based cultivation.

01:00:58.110 --> 01:01:00.000
Why don't you go in there?

01:01:04.220 --> 01:01:06.580
Look at this.

01:01:06.580 --> 01:01:09.680
If you get lost, you'll be an old lady in no time.

01:01:09.680 --> 01:01:10.530
An old lady?

01:01:10.530 --> 01:01:12.210
Let's understand each other.

01:01:12.210 --> 01:01:14.150
Human honesty is the best.

01:01:14.150 --> 01:01:27.520
I'm glad I was able to go home safely.

01:01:30.760 --> 01:01:33.060
"Oh, it's the spring of growth, isn't it?"

01:01:33.060 --> 01:01:35.540
"That's right! This is the best!"

01:01:35.540 --> 01:01:38.050
"No, Rina Inverse."

01:01:38.050 --> 01:01:39.410
"You say that a lot."

01:01:39.410 --> 01:01:40.010
"Huh?"

01:01:40.010 --> 01:01:41.160
"Lies, too."

01:01:41.160 --> 01:01:43.090
"Houbento."

01:01:43.090 --> 01:01:44.890
"Who?"

01:01:47.850 --> 01:01:49.620
"It's Rina Inverse."

01:01:50.320 --> 01:01:55.090
"Thank you."

01:02:01.180 --> 01:02:01.680
*sniff*

01:02:01.680 --> 01:02:02.200
*sniff*

01:02:02.200 --> 01:02:16.730
*sniff*

01:02:16.730 --> 01:02:17.670
*sniff*
